00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
A love story, unequaled.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Bridegroom is a documentary, drama film directed by Linda Bloodworth-Thomason.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
A documentary that tells the emotional journey of Shane and Tom, two young men in a loving and committed
relationship — a relationship that was cut tragically short by a misstep off the side of a roof.

4
