Herself, played by Judy Crone.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Bridegroom (full title: Bridegroom: A Love Story, Unequaled) is a 2013 American documentary film about the
relationship between two young gay men, produced and directed by Linda Bloodworth-Thomason.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Bridegroom premiered at the 2013 Tribeca Film Festival on April 23, 2013, and attracted further press coverage
because its premiere screening at the festival was introduced by former President Bill Clinton.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film won the festival's Audience Award for Best Documentary Film.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film jointly received the 2014 GLAAD Media Award for
Outstanding Documentary alongside Call Me Kuchu.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film explores themes of marriage crisis,
marriage, equality, love, death of lover.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The tone is emotional.
